                syntax:
            `Minimum Spanning Tree

            Input

            Connected Weighted Graph

            ↓

            Apply MST Algorithm

            ↓

            Output

            Minimum Cost Tree

            --------------------------------

            Prim's Algorithm

            Step 1: Select any starting vertex.

            Step 2: Choose the minimum weight edge.

            Step 3: Add the adjacent unvisited vertex.

            Step 4: Repeat until all vertices are included.

            Time Complexity

            O(E log V)

            --------------------------------

            Kruskal's Algorithm

            Step 1: Sort all edges by weight.

            Step 2: Select the smallest edge.

            Step 3: Add the edge if it does not form a cycle.

            Step 4: Repeat until (V−1) edges are selected.

            Time Complexity

            O(E log E)`,

